fixes={0:'Correction for attempt 2: The previous result looked like a decorated stone chest. Draw an unmistakable single mechanical keyboard key: a simple square blank DARK FORGED-IRON face, broad gold bevel along its top edge, and a short vertical front skirt. Keep the key front-facing and square. Make the two sound arcs much smaller than the key, each thick and simple, ember-gold. The key face stays completely plain and dark. Fine ornament is only faint low-contrast grain. The key and arcs form the entire subject.',3:'Correction for attempt 2: The previous result incorrectly copied the speaker reference. Draw an unmistakable mechanical keyboard KEY on the LEFT: one square blank dark face, thick gold top bevel, short front skirt. On the RIGHT, exactly THREE STRAIGHT VERTICAL RECTANGULAR BARS, flat tops, each bar rising taller from left to right. Their gold fronts carry broad warm highlights. The complete subject is KEY plus BAR CHART. Preserve wide empty gaps between the bars. All faces are plain; outline is dark forged iron. The reference speakers supply only material finish.',4:'Correction for attempt 2: The previous result looked like a box and had an ivory face. Draw an unmistakable single mechanical keyboard key, orthographic front view: one square blank DARK JADE face, thick plain gold top bevel, and one short dark front skirt. The two sound arcs are clearly CURVED CRESCENTS to its RIGHT, and much smaller than the key. The key face is completely plain jade, and all ornament is faint surface texture. Large simple surfaces, dark outline, broad highlights. The entire object is key plus two sound crescents.',7:'Correction for attempt 2: The previous gear had a sun-star in its hub, perpetuating the wrong reading. The central hub is a large completely PLAIN DARK CIRCULAR RECESS. A thick solid gold gear body surrounds that recess, with exactly eight chunky rectangular gear teeth JOINED directly to the thick body. The thick joined teeth are the most obvious feature at tiny size. A simple round dark-jade plate sits behind the solid gear. Gold faces are broad polished bevels with only faint texture. The dark round hub occupies 35 percent of the gear diameter. Keep every face plain and quiet; the entire subject is a mechanical cogwheel.'}
for i,fix in fixes.items():
 j=jobs[i].copy(); j['attempt']=2;j['output']=j['output'].replace('try1','try2');j['prompt']+='\n'+fix+'\n'; jobs.append(j)
p.write_text(json.dumps(jobs,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
